  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="Tag823" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;!--?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="no"?--&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class="Section_1"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;1.&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;General&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-style: italic;"&gt;Organization&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Stagecoach Pipeline &amp;amp; Storage Company LLC (SPSC) is a New York limited liability company formed in 2001 and is an indirect wholly-owned subsidiary of Kinder Morgan, Inc. (KMI). For purposes of this report, references to &amp;#8220;us,&amp;#8221; &amp;#8220;we,&amp;#8221; &amp;#8220;our,&amp;#8221; &amp;#8220;the Company,&amp;#8221; or &amp;#8220;Respondent&amp;#8221; refer to SPSC solely in its capacity as the owner and operator of the North-South and Marc I Projects (described below). References to SPSC refer to SPSC in its capacity as a legal entity, thus capturing all of the company's assets and operations (including the North-South and Marc I Projects).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-style: italic;"&gt;Description of Operations&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;SPSC owns natural gas transportation and natural gas storage facilities that are regulated by the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (FERC). &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Respondent offers firm wheeling services through its North and South Laterals to/from Tennessee Gas Pipeline&amp;#8217;s (TGP) 300 Line and the Millennium Pipeline and various points in between under negotiated and discounted rate contracts (subject to cost-of-service recourse rates). SPSC&amp;#8217;s South Lateral connects the Stagecoach Central Compressor Station in Tioga County, New York to TGP&amp;#8217;s 300 Line in Bradford County, Pennsylvania. The SPSC North Lateral connects the Stagecoach Central Compressor Station to the Millennium Pipeline in Tioga County, New York. The Marc I Project facilities extend from the Respondent's Stagecoach South Lateral interconnect with TGP's 300 Line southward to Transcontinental Gas Pipeline Corporation's (Transco) Leidy Line.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The SPSC natural gas storage facility provides storage services to customers under market-based rate authority granted by the FERC.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-style: italic;"&gt;Basis of Presentation&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The Respondent's financial statements are prepared in accordance with the accounting requirements of the FERC as set forth in its applicable Uniform System of Accounts and published accounting releases, which is a comprehensive basis of accounting other than accounting principles generally accepted in the United States of America (US GAAP). In management&amp;#8217;s opinion, these financial statements reflect normal and recurring adjustments that are necessary for a fair presentation of our financial results for the interim periods presented, and adequate disclosures have been made to make the information presented not misleading. These interim financial statements should be read along with the financial statements and related notes included in our 2025 Annual Report of Major Natural Gas Companies on Form No. 2.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The Respondent's financial statements are inclusive of only a portion of SPSC&amp;#8217;s financial results, representing the results exclusively of the North-South and Marc I Projects. As such, these financial statements do not reflect the financial position and results of operations of SPSC as a legal entity. Storage-related revenues are not included in the results of operations in these financial statements. Expenses are directly assigned to the cost-based transportation services whenever possible and expenses that are specifically unique to providing market-based storage services have been excluded for the periods presented. Where direct assignment of costs is not possible, costs are allocated to the Marc I facilities and the North-South Lateral facilities based on gross plant balances for each. The North-South Lateral allocation is further broken down between cost-based and market-based activities on the laterals based on the percentage of contract demand for cost-based services relative to total contract demand on the laterals. The expenses allocated to market-based activities and services as described above are excluded for the periods presented.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Management has evaluated subsequent events through August 26, 2026, the date the financial statements were available to be issued.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;2.&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Related Party Transactions&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
